4
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,140
How do I remember

5
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:12,260
I didn't even go by the river yesterday.

6
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,940
The person who looked at Li Xiaoyue’s body

7
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,580
It seems to be Xu Dali

8
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,100
What the hell is going on?

9
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,500
Liu Fang didn’t swear that

10
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,020
