17
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:38,980
If it weren't for you, Xu Dali

18
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:39,900
Then if you want to calculate it like this

19
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,380
Li Xiaoming also insisted on asking me to go.

20
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,820
Is Li Xiaoming to be blamed? This is you

21
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:45,790
Huzi, you see what happened?

22
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:47,510
