23
00:00:47,510 --> 00:00:49,350
My Xiaoyue also said that I won’t marry anyone but you.

24
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:50,830
Although she was naked by Xu Dali

25
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:51,990
