26
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:53,430
As long as Huzi, don’t take it to heart

27
00:00:53,430 --> 00:01:01,800
Our old Li family can still accept your Li Abacus.

28
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,600
Fortunately, you have been studying for a few years.

29
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:08,820
You can also say this kind of thing. Li Dongyang, don’t think I don’t know.

30
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:10,180
Your daughter is pregnant with someone else's seed

31
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,140
The entire forest farm

32
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:12,740
Now only Xu Dali dares to marry her

33
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:14,660
you how do you know

34
00:01:17,390 --> 00:01:18,910
I know more than that

35
00:01:19,350 --> 00:01:20,830
Your family dares to plot against my family again

36
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:27,300
Let go of that shitty thing between you and your sister-in-law. You can't talk nonsense. Who is talking nonsense?

37
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:28,580
