38
00:01:28,580 --> 00:01:31,380
If you dare to rant again, I can't guarantee whether these words will spread.

39
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:49,830
Thanks for the little thing, Uncle Foreigner

40
00:01:49,830 --> 00:01:53,670
I'm just telling the truth, okay, you guys are busy, I'll leave first.

41
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,520
